## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Database — Bổ sung permission TopicCategories cho Creator

> [!NOTE]
> Phase này chỉ có 1 câu SQL bổ sung.

#### [NEW] migration_creator_topic_categories.sql (hoặc chạy trực tiếp)

```sql
-- Gán MANAGE_TOPIC_CATEGORIES cho ContentCreator
INSERT INTO dbo.RolePermissions (RoleID, PermissionID)
SELECT r.RoleID, p.PermissionID
FROM dbo.Roles r
JOIN dbo.Permissions p ON p.PermissionCode = N'MANAGE_TOPIC_CATEGORIES'
WHERE r.RoleName = N'ContentCreator'
  AND NOT EXISTS (
    SELECT 1 FROM dbo.RolePermissions rp
    WHERE rp.RoleID = r.RoleID AND rp.PermissionID = p.PermissionID
  );
```

