Service tách biệt khỏi `admin.service.js`, mọi query CRUD **luôn filter** `CreatedByUserID = currentUserID`:

**Dashboard & Analytics** (PLAN 11.2):
- `getDashboardStats(userId)` — query `vw_ContentCreatorContentSummary WHERE UserID = userId`
- `getContentSummary(userId)` — chi tiết nội dung theo status
- `getTopicAnalytics(userId, topicId)` — query `vw_TopicLearningAnalytics` join `Topics WHERE CreatedByUserID = userId`
- `getMiniTestAnalytics(userId, miniTestId)` — query `vw_MiniTestAnalytics` join `MiniTests WHERE CreatedByUserID = userId`

**TopicCategories CRUD** (PLAN 11.3):
- `getTopicCategories()` — lấy tất cả (hiển thị cho chọn)
- `createTopicCategory(data, userId)` — tạo mới
- `updateTopicCategory(id, data, userId)` — sửa, check ownership
- `deleteTopicCategory(id, userId)` — xóa, check ownership
- Admin bypass ownership

**Topics CRUD** (PLAN 11.4):
- `getMyTopics(userId, filters)` — filter `CreatedByUserID`
- `createTopic(data, userId)` — `ContentStatus = 'Draft'`, `CreatedByUserID = userId`
- `updateTopic(id, data, userId)` — check ownership
- `deleteTopic(id, userId)` — check ownership, chỉ xóa Draft
- `submitTopicForReview(id, userId)` — đổi `PendingReview`, ghi `ContentReviewLogs`

**Words CRUD** (PLAN 11.5):
- `getMyWords(userId, filters)`, `createWord()`, `updateWord()`, `deleteWord()`
- `submitWordForReview(id, userId)`
- Bao gồm `ExampleSentences` CRUD inline (tạo/sửa/xóa câu ví dụ kèm word)
- Bao gồm `WordTopics` assignment (gán word vào topics)

**Questions CRUD** (PLAN 11.6):
- `getMyQuestions(userId)`, `createQuestion()`, `updateQuestion()`, `deleteQuestion()`
- `submitQuestionForReview(id, userId)`

**MiniTests CRUD** (PLAN 11.7):
- `getMyMiniTests(userId)`, `createMiniTest()`, `updateMiniTest()`, `deleteMiniTest()`
- `addMiniTestItem(testId, questionId, displayOrder, userId)` — gắn question
- `removeMiniTestItem(testId, questionId, userId)` — gỡ question
- `submitMiniTestForReview(id, userId)` — check tất cả questions đã Published

**Media CRUD** (PLAN 11.8):
- `getMyMediaAssets(userId)` — filter `UploadedByUserID`
- `uploadMediaAsset(file, metadata, userId)` — lưu file + insert `MediaAssets`
- `deleteMediaAsset(id, userId)` — check ownership
- `linkMediaToContent(mediaId, entityType, entityId, purpose, order)`
- `unlinkMedia(contentMediaLinkId)`

**Common helper**: `checkOwnership(tableName, idColumn, recordId, userId, userRole)` — Admin bypass, Creator check.

