Thêm middleware `checkOwnership(tableName, idColumn, paramName)` — generic ownership check:
- Nếu `req.user.role === 'Admin'` → cho qua
- Nếu `req.user.role === 'ContentCreator'` → query `SELECT 1 FROM {table} WHERE {idColumn} = {paramValue} AND CreatedByUserID = {userId}`
- Nếu không match → 403 Forbidden

